# Conformance probe pack used as an inner pack (spec 0.34, ruling 7): a list
# with an 8-bit count. Most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   nums        an 8-bit count, then that many items, val in 8 bits each
format     conformance-inner-countonly
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.nums count 8
  field  probe.val  8  uint
end
